  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 14th level, whenever a runesmith inscribes his runes for the day, he may inscribe two Lesser equipment runes on the same item as though they were a single Greater rune. Similarly, he may inscribe two Lesser projection runes as though they were a single Greater rune. This consumes a Greater inscription slot. Activating a combined rune activates both runes at once. The activation cost is equal to the greater of the activation costs of the two runes, and the activation time is equal to the greater of the activation times of the two runes.</p>\n<p>A runesmith may inscribe a single advanced compound rune per day.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/runesmith#toc18\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
